  "details": "Hi, I'm yzen,\n\nWhen I’m severely affected by single-connection speed limits imposed by the Firewall (GFW), Deep Packet Inspection (DPI), or ISP restrictions, an idea came to mind.\n\nEvery time I join a friend’s world and load my avatar, it can take up to ten minutes or even half an hour or more, with speeds sometimes not exceeding 1 MB/s.\n\nCould we add “segmented download” functions and logic to the VRChat client—similar to NDM or IDM—using the simplest yet most proven and effective method to get bypass this problem?",
